<title>USA: Central U.S. carlot pork at 1500 CST - USDA.</title>
<headline>Central U.S. carlot pork at 1500 CST - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1997-02-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fresh pork loins were $1.00 lower; butts weak to 1.00 lower; spareribs 1.00 higher; lower; seedless bellies 1.00-2.00 higher for immediate; lean trimmings 1.00-4.00 higher.</p>
<p>Trading was slow, with light demand light to moderate offerings.</p>
